{"1585100": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Snow War", "steam_appid": 1585100, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h1>Early Access 3rd April!</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are super excited to announce that Snow War is coming to Steam Early Access 3rd of April 2026!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/dd0c5427ad6944fd4bc251ae217e81ba.poster.avif?t=1780832964\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/dd0c5427ad6944fd4bc251ae217e81ba.webm?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/dd0c5427ad6944fd4bc251ae217e81ba.mp4?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow War is a <strong>First Person Snowball</strong> game. No blood, no gore — just pure, chaotic fun where every hit counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set as a classic &quot;Boomer Shooter&quot; FPS with Arena Multiplayer, we replaced the (boring) starting pistol with <strong>snowballs</strong>. This makes hitting frustrating to learn and impossible to master. Snow War is not for the weakest of hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/62a7cd4058b3a915fceb419d841491e1.avif?t=1780832964\" width=640 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While snowballs are the bread and butter of your victory, the actual key is elsewhere. You must find gadgets that protect you, boost your throws, or give you a temporary edge. <i>Use them wisely — batteries don’t last forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/cb18075bb1b7acaf83d229a42ef2672e.poster.avif?t=1780832964\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/cb18075bb1b7acaf83d229a42ef2672e.webm?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/cb18075bb1b7acaf83d229a42ef2672e.mp4?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Battle across neon‑lit cities and pine‑covered forests. Climb the scoreboard and prove you’re the champion of the frozen wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic PvP FPS (First Person Snowball) action for up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free‑for‑all mode (team modes planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online or LAN play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline bots for practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of power‑ups that change the flow of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom servers with adjustable rules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Jump in, throw some snowballs, and tell us what you want to see next. Early Access is just the beginning!</i></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/dd0c5427ad6944fd4bc251ae217e81ba.poster.avif?t=1780832964\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/dd0c5427ad6944fd4bc251ae217e81ba.webm?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/dd0c5427ad6944fd4bc251ae217e81ba.mp4?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Snow War is a <strong>First Person Snowball</strong> game. No blood, no gore — just pure, chaotic fun where every hit counts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set as a classic &quot;Boomer Shooter&quot; FPS with Arena Multiplayer, we replaced the (boring) starting pistol with <strong>snowballs</strong>. This makes hitting frustrating to learn and impossible to master. Snow War is not for the weakest of hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/62a7cd4058b3a915fceb419d841491e1.avif?t=1780832964\" width=640 height=280 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While snowballs are the bread and butter of your victory, the actual key is elsewhere. You must find gadgets that protect you, boost your throws, or give you a temporary edge. <i>Use them wisely — batteries don’t last forever.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/cb18075bb1b7acaf83d229a42ef2672e.poster.avif?t=1780832964\" width=640 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/cb18075bb1b7acaf83d229a42ef2672e.webm?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/extras/cb18075bb1b7acaf83d229a42ef2672e.mp4?t=1780832964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So what are you waiting for? Battle across neon‑lit cities and pine‑covered forests. Climb the scoreboard and prove you’re the champion of the frozen wasteland.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >❄️ <strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic PvP FPS (First Person Snowball) action for up to 16 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Free‑for‑all mode (team modes planned)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Online or LAN play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Offline bots for practice</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character customization</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A variety of power‑ups that change the flow of battle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom servers with adjustable rules</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Jump in, throw some snowballs, and tell us what you want to see next. Early Access is just the beginning!</i></strong></p>", "short_description": "Neon lights, big hair, and mountains of snow — the 80s never ended in the frozen world of Snow War. Grab your snowballs, gear up with homemade gadgets, and dive into fast‑paced, retro‑flavored action.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/97500e1769dca755ff04d143f79a66a95233b7f5/header.jpg?t=1780832964", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/cf1a8d4d0c302ca2bfd1f448fad363c2d04305c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780832964", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1585100/cf1a8d4d0c302ca2bfd1f448fad363c2d043